<title>USA: Sunbeam Corp hires Ogilvy &amp; Mather.</title>
<headline>Sunbeam Corp hires Ogilvy &amp; Mather.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunbeam Corp said Tuesday it selected Ogilvy &amp; Mather to assist its new marketing team in the development and execution of a global marketing strategy to re-energize the Sunbeam brand.</p>
<p>Ogilvy, a unit of WPP Group PLC, will help Sunbeam reposition and build its brand of small appliances, both nationally and internationally, using advertising and other integrated marketing components, the company said.</p>
<p>Sunbeam said it has not spent enough on the brand in terms of advertising support recently.</p>
<p>No one from Sunbeam or Ogilvy &amp; Mather was available to comment on the terms of the contract.</p>
</text>
